<title>USA: NYCE certificated cotton stocks drop to 135,252.</title>
<headline>NYCE certificated cotton stocks drop to 135,252.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 9 totaled 135,252 bales, down from 135,468 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 170 bales issued, 386 cancellations, 833 decertification orders, and no bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
